2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
星炎 Fierstra Diva 虎金妃笑虎 3D Live 2026
Seien - Fierstra Diva - Koganehi Niko 3D Live 2026

3
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:52,500
幾千の 時を巡って今
Spanning across thousands of ages, now...

4
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:56,500
僕ら出会えたの
we have finally found each other.

5
00:04:56,800 --> 00:05:00,000
ほら 見失わない
Look, I won't lose sight of you...

6
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:01,808
...ように
...so that...

7
00:05:01,808 --> 00:05:05,708
手を離さないで
...you won't let go of my hand.

8
00:05:08,008 --> 00:05:11,508
星降る海
[Ocean of Falling Stars]

9
00:05:25,008 --> 00:05:28,508
ねぇ 耳を澄ませて
Hey, listen closely...

10
00:05:28,508 --> 00:05:33,808
星の降る音聞こえるでしょう
You can hear the sound of falling stars, right?

11
00:05:34,508 --> 00:05:38,008
もっと近くに来て
Come a little closer.

12
00:05:38,008 --> 00:05:43,208
誰も知らない世界が待ってるの
A world nobody knows is waiting for us.

13
00:05:43,808 --> 00:05:47,808
手をとって踊りましょう
Take my hand and let's dance.

14
00:05:47,808 --> 00:05:52,508
始まりの合図鳴らせば
When the signal to begin sounds,

15
00:05:52,508 --> 00:05:58,008
歌を 響け
Sing! Resound!

16
00:05:58,008 --> 00:06:05,008
暗闇の道も続き 明かりが照らすの
Even along dark paths, light will shine through.

17
00:06:06,808 --> 00:06:13,808
空 海の向こう 君のもとまで
Across the sky and sea, all the way to you,

18
00:06:13,808 --> 00:06:17,508
響くように歌えるかな
I wonder if I can sing so that it reaches you.

19
00:06:17,808 --> 00:06:23,208
どんなときも ここに立ってるよ
No matter when, I'll be standing right here,

20
00:06:23,208 --> 00:06:27,208
祈っているからさ
Because I'm praying for you.

21
00:06:27,208 --> 00:06:34,808
ほら キラキラ輝く星は
Look, the sparkling, shining stars...

22
00:06:34,808 --> 00:06:40,008
色褪せず太古から
Never fading since ancient times,

23
00:06:40,008 --> 00:06:46,508
照らし続けてる 君と辿り着けるさ
Keep shining on us. Together, we can reach it.

24
00:06:55,208 --> 00:06:59,008
心には逢いたい
In my heart, there's someone I want to see.

25
00:06:59,008 --> 00:07:04,208
誰かが居て 羅針盤みたいね
They act just like my compass.

26
00:07:04,508 --> 00:07:08,508
そっと目を開けてみて
Gently open your eyes...

27
00:07:08,508 --> 00:07:13,808
見えるものだけが リアルじゃないの
Reality isn't only what you can see with your eyes.

28
00:07:14,208 --> 00:07:22,508
君と居る世界は 童話の記憶に眠るのさ
The world I inhabit with you lies asleep in memories of fairy tales.

29
00:07:22,508 --> 00:07:27,508
歌を 響け
Sing! Resound!

30
00:07:27,508 --> 00:07:35,008
潮の満ち引きが満ちていくの
The ebb and flow of the tide swells up.

31
00:07:35,508 --> 00:07:45,008
途切れかけた 夢を見ても大丈夫 一人にはしないよ
Even if your dream nearly breaks apart, it's okay. I won't leave you alone.

32
00:07:45,008 --> 00:07:55,508
何度だって 互いの引力で 引き寄せ合うんだよ
Time and time again, through our mutual gravity, we draw each other close.

33
00:07:56,008 --> 00:08:02,808
空 海の匂い 君に届いたかな
Across the sky, did the scent of the sea reach you?

34
00:08:02,808 --> 00:08:07,008
距離なんてないのかな
I wonder if distance even exists between us.

35
00:08:07,008 --> 00:08:15,508
こんなときも きっとどこかで 見守っているからさ
Even at times like this, surely somewhere, I'm watching over you.

36
00:08:15,508 --> 00:08:21,008
ほら くしゃくしゃになって笑う
Look, bursting into laughter...

37
00:08:21,008 --> 00:08:25,508
日々を集めて紡いだ未来
A future spun from gathering those days.

38
00:08:25,508 --> 00:08:30,008
一歩踏み出す先も 君と
Even the step forward lies together with you,

39
00:08:30,008 --> 00:08:38,008
心震わせて
Making our hearts tremble.

40
00:08:43,008 --> 00:08:47,508
重なる幸いは
Overlapping fortunes...

41
00:08:47,508 --> 00:08:54,008
物語を巡るわ
...traverse through our story.

42
00:09:03,008 --> 00:09:06,008
ニコたんが来たー！
Nikotan is here!

43
00:09:06,008 --> 00:09:10,508
hololive DEV_IS FLOWGLOWのお笑い担当、虎金妃ニコです！
I'm Koganei Niko, in charge of comedy for hololive DEV_IS FLOWGLOW!

44
00:09:10,508 --> 00:09:14,008
ニコたんだよー！誕生日だー！ガオー！
It's Nikotan~! It's my birthday~! Rawr~!

45
00:09:14,008 --> 00:09:19,808
ニコたん初の生誕ライブ「聖炎 -FIRESTRA DIVA-」にご来場いただき
Thank you all so much for coming to Nikotan's first birthday live, "Sacred Flame -FIRESTRA DIVA-"!

46
00:09:19,808 --> 00:09:21,008
ありがとうございます！
Thank you very much!

47
00:09:21,008 --> 00:09:25,008
本日のハッシュタグは #ニコたん生たん2026
Today's hashtag is #NikotanSeitan2026!

48
00:09:25,008 --> 00:09:27,208
たん はニコたんの「たん」なので平仮名です！
The "tan" is the same "tan" as in Nikotan, so it's spelled in hiragana!

49
00:09:27,208 --> 00:09:32,008
こちらでね、スクショたくさん撮って感想どしどしポストしてください！
Take lots of screenshots with that and post your impressions!

50
00:09:32,008 --> 00:09:33,208
頼んます！
Please, I'm counting on you!

51
00:09:33,208 --> 00:09:37,008
今回のタイトル「聖炎 -FIRESTRA DIVA-」、こちらは
The title of this concert, "Sacred Flame -FIRESTRA DIVA-",

52
00:09:37,008 --> 00:09:44,808
FIRESTRA、「炎」「星」「虎」の3つの要素を掛け合わせたトリプルミーニング！
has a triple meaning combining "Flame" (FIRE), "Star" (ASTRA), and "Tiger" (TORA)!

53
00:09:44,808 --> 00:09:46,508
ニコたんが作っちゃいました！
Nikotan came up with it herself!

54
00:09:46,508 --> 00:09:50,008
まあニコたんが星で、みんなから炎もらってて〜みたいな！
Like, Nikotan is the star, and I'm receiving flames from everyone~!

55
00:09:50,008 --> 00:09:53,508
フェスでさ、初めてのフェスでみんなのペンライト赤かったでしょ？
Remember at the festival—my first festival—everyone's penlights were red, right?

56
00:09:53,508 --> 00:09:56,508
あれはね、炎だったの！このライブの匂わせをしていたわけです！
That was actually flame! I was dropping hints for this live concert all along!

57
00:09:56,508 --> 00:09:59,008
計画通りってわけよ！
It was all according to plan!

58
00:10:00,216 --> 00:10:03,516
D私と そんなニコたんの炎を感じられるような感じで
This live performance is centered on singing lots of songs where you can feel the spark between D-watashi and Nicotan...

59
00:10:03,516 --> 00:10:06,616
たくさん歌っていく歌唱がメインのライブになっております
...where you can feel our passion as we sing our hearts out!

60
00:10:06,816 --> 00:10:09,816
1曲目は『星振る海』を歌わせていただきました
For the first song, we performed "Hoshi Furu Umi."

61
00:10:09,916 --> 00:10:14,316
皆さん どうでしたでしょうか？ニコたん 清楚でしたでしょうか？
How was it, everyone? Was Nicotan refined and graceful?

62
00:10:14,516 --> 00:10:17,316
この後はゲストのD私との時間です
Up next is our time with guest D-watashi!

63
00:10:17,316 --> 00:10:20,116
それではゲストパート レッツゴー！
And now, for the guest section, let's go!

64
00:10:29,016 --> 00:10:33,816
涙が 夜に溶けて 空が今日も遠くなる
My tears melt into the night, and the sky grows distant again today.

65
00:10:33,816 --> 00:10:38,816
未来が 閉じたように 暗闇が満ちている
As if the future has closed up, darkness fills the air.

66
00:10:38,816 --> 00:10:43,616
醜い心も 掠れそうな言葉も
My ugly heart, and my fading words too...

67
00:10:43,616 --> 00:10:50,016
すべて透かしたように 星が輝いていた
As if seeing through it all, the stars were shining.

68
00:11:10,816 --> 00:11:15,516
夜鷹のように高く 空を駆けていけたら
If only I could fly high through the sky like a nightjar,

69
00:11:15,516 --> 00:11:20,516
綺麗だって囃されて 特別になれたのに
I would have been praised as beautiful and become special.

70
00:11:20,516 --> 00:11:25,516
そう 俯いた目には 憧れしか映らない
Yes, my downcast eyes reflect nothing but yearning.

71
00:11:25,516 --> 00:11:30,016
誰かの書いた地図じゃ 灯る場所は探せない
I can't find my place to shine using a map drawn by someone else.

72
00:11:30,016 --> 00:11:35,016
僕らの現実は 情けなくふっと息して
Our reality pathetically sighs,

73
00:11:35,016 --> 00:11:40,016
気を抜けば明日が 昨日になってしまう
and if we let our guard down, tomorrow will turn into yesterday.

74
00:11:42,016 --> 00:11:46,516
これはそう 今日を諦めなかった故のストーリー
This is, yes, the story of not giving up on today.

75
00:11:46,516 --> 00:11:51,516
風切り羽で響かせて 空を目指して
Letting our flight feathers resonate, aiming for the sky.

76
00:11:51,516 --> 00:11:56,516
惨めになって嫌になったって 輝いてる夢を叶え
Even if I feel miserable and hate it all, I'll fulfill my shining dream.

77
00:11:56,516 --> 00:12:01,016
羽はとっくの昔に生えていた
The wings had sprouted a long time ago.

78
00:12:01,016 --> 00:12:06,016
吐き出す息が白さ増して 声も聞こえなくなって
My exhaled breath turns white, and my voice can no longer be heard.

79
00:12:06,016 --> 00:12:11,016
燃え上がる体温が夜空を焦がすまで
Until my burning body heat scorches the night sky.

80
00:12:11,016 --> 00:12:17,516
誰よりもっともっと越えて 羽ばたいた星の一瞬を
Going far, far beyond anyone else, that instant of a soaring star...

81
00:12:20,516 --> 00:12:25,516
夜空はずっと待っている 灯る日を待っている
The night sky has always been waiting, waiting for the day to ignite.

82
00:12:25,516 --> 00:12:32,016
きっと きっと
Surely, surely...

83
00:12:36,016 --> 00:12:40,816
いつか、なんて誤魔化して 誰かに擦り付けて
Deceiving myself with "someday", shifting the blame onto someone else...

84
00:12:40,816 --> 00:12:45,516
どこか、なんて慰めて 何かにすがっている
Comforting myself with "somewhere", clinging to something...

85
00:12:45,516 --> 00:12:50,516
それこそが僕だ 汚れ切った心だ
That's exactly who I am, a completely tainted heart.

86
00:12:50,516 --> 00:12:55,516
夜鷹にはなれないな だから今日飛んだんだ
I can't become a nightjar, that's why I flew today.

87
00:12:55,516 --> 00:13:00,516
僕らの結末は 面白いくらい弱気で
Our ending is absurdly faint-hearted,

88
00:13:00,516 --> 00:13:06,016
予測なんて一つも 当てにならないから
because not a single prediction can be relied upon.

89
00:13:06,816 --> 00:13:11,516
これはまだ 僕を諦めなかった故のストーリー
This is still the story of not giving up on myself.

90
00:13:11,516 --> 00:13:16,516
枯れた喉を響かせて 後悔を追い越して
Letting my dry throat resonate, overtaking regret.

91
00:13:16,516 --> 00:13:21,516
世界にとって僕にとって ふさわしかった役なんて
A role that was suitable for the world or for me...

92
00:13:21,516 --> 00:13:26,516
いらない 知らない 所詮僕ら僕らだ
I don't need it, I don't care, after all we are who we are.

93
00:13:26,516 --> 00:13:31,016
それならどうかこの涙を 忘れないで
In that case, please, don't forget these tears.

94
00:13:31,016 --> 00:13:36,016
疲れ果ててこの空から 落ちるまで
Until I'm completely exhausted and fall from this sky.

95
00:13:36,016 --> 00:13:42,516
今よりもっともっと越えて 羽ばたいた星が泣いている
Going far, far beyond now, the soaring star is crying...

96
00:13:45,516 --> 00:13:50,516
夜空が白け出している 日が登り出している
The night sky is turning white, the sun is starting to rise.

97
00:13:50,516 --> 00:13:53,516
そっと
Gently...

98
00:14:01,016 --> 00:14:05,516
あれから始まって これから終わっていく
Starting from back then, ending from now on.

99
00:14:05,516 --> 00:14:10,516
一つ一つ一瞬を 確かめていく
Confirming each and every moment.

100
00:14:10,516 --> 00:14:15,516
誰かも同じじゃない 誰にも似ていない
No one is the same, no one is alike.

101
00:14:15,516 --> 00:14:21,516
一人一人とても不確かな 空を飛んでいるのさ
Each and every one of us is flying through a very uncertain sky.

102
00:14:21,516 --> 00:14:26,016
僕らの現実は 気持ち一つでシャープして
Our reality sharpens with a single feeling,

103
00:14:26,016 --> 00:14:31,816
怯えていた明日を 昨日にしてしまえる
and can turn the tomorrow we feared into yesterday.

104
00:14:32,016 --> 00:14:37,016
これはそう 今日を諦めなかった故のストーリー
This is, yes, the story of not giving up on today.

105
00:14:37,016 --> 00:14:42,016
風切り羽で響かせて 空を目指して
Letting our flight feathers resonate, aiming for the sky.

106
00:14:42,016 --> 00:14:46,516
惨めになって嫌になったって 輝いてる夢を叶え
Even if I feel miserable and hate it all, I'll fulfill my shining dream.

107
00:14:46,516 --> 00:14:51,516
羽はとっくの昔に生えていた
The wings had sprouted a long time ago.

108
00:14:51,516 --> 00:14:56,516
吐き出す息が白さ増して 声も聞こえなくなって
My exhaled breath turns white, and my voice can no longer be heard.

109
00:14:56,516 --> 00:15:01,016
燃え上がる体温が夜空を焦がすまで
Until my burning body heat scorches the night sky.

110
00:15:00,104 --> 00:15:01,104
...澄み渡って
Clear and serene,

111
00:15:01,204 --> 00:15:03,304
誰よりもっと遠くへ
farther than anyone else,

112
00:15:03,404 --> 00:15:05,604
羽ばたいた星の
the instant of a star

113
00:15:05,704 --> 00:15:08,104
一瞬が
taking flight...

114
00:15:10,904 --> 00:15:13,904
青空を照らし出している
is illuminating the blue sky,

115
00:15:14,004 --> 00:15:16,604
淡く光っている
gently shining,

116
00:15:16,704 --> 00:15:18,604
ずっと
forever,

117
00:15:18,704 --> 00:15:20,604
ずっと
forever,

118
00:15:20,704 --> 00:15:24,104
ずっと
forever.

119
00:16:00,104 --> 00:16:05,104
Magia

120
00:16:16,304 --> 00:16:21,904
いつか君が瞳に灯す愛の光が
Someday, the light of love you kindle in your eyes

121
00:16:22,104 --> 00:16:24,004
時を超えて
will transcend time,

122
00:16:24,104 --> 00:16:28,904
滅び急ぐ世界の夢を
and surely destroy one dream

123
00:16:29,004 --> 00:16:31,604
確かに一つ
of a world rushing to ruin...

124
00:16:31,704 --> 00:16:33,904
壊すだろう
it will surely shatter.

125
00:16:34,004 --> 00:16:38,904
躊躇いを飲み干して
Drinking down your hesitation,

126
00:16:39,004 --> 00:16:41,604
君が望むものは何？
what is it that you desire?

127
00:16:41,704 --> 00:16:44,304
こんな欲望深い憧れの
At the end of such a covetous longing,

128
00:16:44,404 --> 00:16:46,904
行方に儚い
is there a fleeting tomorrow

129
00:16:47,004 --> 00:16:48,904
明日はあるの？
waiting for us?

130
00:16:49,004 --> 00:16:52,304
子供の頃夢に見てた
Like the ancient magic

131
00:16:52,404 --> 00:16:55,904
古の魔法のように
I dreamed of as a child,

132
00:16:56,104 --> 00:17:00,104
闇さえ砕く力で
with power that can shatter even the darkness,

133
00:17:00,304 --> 00:17:03,904
微笑む君に会いたい
I want to meet you smiling.

134
00:17:04,104 --> 00:17:07,904
怯えるこの手の中には
In these trembling hands

135
00:17:08,104 --> 00:17:11,904
手折られた花の勇気
lies the courage of a plucked flower;

136
00:17:12,104 --> 00:17:15,904
思いだけが頼る全て
my feelings are all I can rely on

137
00:17:16,104 --> 00:17:18,904
光を
to awaken

138
00:17:19,004 --> 00:17:21,104
呼び覚ます
the light...

139
00:17:21,204 --> 00:17:28,104
願い
My wish.

140
00:17:28,904 --> 00:17:34,904
いつか君も誰かの為に 強い力を
Someday, you too will seek a strong power

141
00:17:35,104 --> 00:17:37,104
望むのだろう
for the sake of someone else.

142
00:17:37,204 --> 00:17:41,904
愛が胸を捉えた夜に
On the night love grips your heart,

143
00:17:42,104 --> 00:17:44,904
未知の言葉が
unknown words

144
00:17:45,004 --> 00:17:47,904
生まれてくる
will come to life.

145
00:17:48,004 --> 00:17:50,904
迷わずに行けるなら
If I can go without wavering,

146
00:17:51,004 --> 00:17:54,904
心が砕けてもいいわ
I don't care if my heart breaks.

147
00:17:55,104 --> 00:17:58,904
いつも目の前の哀しみに
I want a spell

148
00:17:59,004 --> 00:18:00,904
立ち向かうための
to confront the sorrow

149
00:18:01,004 --> 00:18:03,904
呪文が欲しい
that always stands before my eyes.

150
00:18:04,004 --> 00:18:07,904
君はまだ夢見る記憶
You are a memory still dreaming,

151
00:18:08,104 --> 00:18:10,904
私は眠らない明日
while I face a sleepless tomorrow.

152
00:18:11,104 --> 00:18:14,904
二人が出会う奇跡を
To claim the miracle

153
00:18:15,104 --> 00:18:18,104
勝ち取るために進むわ
of our meeting, I will push forward.

154
00:18:18,204 --> 00:18:21,904
怯えるこの手の中には
In these trembling hands

155
00:18:22,104 --> 00:18:25,904
手折られた花の刃
is the blade of a plucked flower;

156
00:18:26,104 --> 00:18:29,904
思いだけが生きる全て
my feelings are all that keeps me alive

157
00:18:30,104 --> 00:18:32,904
心に
as I brandish

158
00:18:33,004 --> 00:18:35,104
振りかざす
my wish

159
00:18:35,204 --> 00:18:41,104
願い
in my heart.

160
00:19:33,604 --> 00:19:38,304
囚われた太陽の輝く
Back when I loved the book of Wonderland

161
00:19:38,604 --> 00:19:46,904
不思議の国の本が好きだった頃
where a captive sun shone bright,

162
00:19:47,104 --> 00:19:51,904
願いはきっと叶うと
I believed in the fairy tales

163
00:19:52,104 --> 00:19:56,904
教えるお伽噺を
that taught me wishes

164
00:19:57,104 --> 00:19:59,904
信じた
would surely come true.

165
00:20:00,125 --> 00:20:04,625
いつか君が瞳に宿す愛の光が
Someday, the light of love that shines in your eyes...

166
00:20:11,925 --> 00:20:15,925
静かに咲き乱れていた
Bloomed wildly in quiet,

167
00:20:15,925 --> 00:20:20,125
古の魔法を優しく
the gentle magic of ancient times.

168
00:20:20,125 --> 00:20:23,925
世界を変える力が
"The power to change the world

169
00:20:23,925 --> 00:20:27,925
その手にあると囁く
lies within your hands," it whispers.

170
00:20:27,925 --> 00:20:31,125
終わらない夢を見よう
Let us dream an endless dream,

171
00:20:31,125 --> 00:20:35,625
君と行く時の中で
in this time I travel with you.

172
00:20:35,625 --> 00:20:39,325
想いだけが生きる全て
My feelings alone are all I live for,

173
00:20:39,325 --> 00:20:43,125
命を作るのは
and what creates my life...

174
00:20:43,125 --> 00:20:46,625
願い
is my wish.

175
00:22:00,125 --> 00:22:03,925
朝まで踊る夢だけ見せて
Show me only a dream of dancing until morning.

176
00:22:03,925 --> 00:22:07,425
時計の鐘が解く魔法
The magic that the clock's chime undoes.

177
00:22:07,425 --> 00:22:11,325
曖昧な指 誘う階段
Ambiguous fingers, inviting stairs,

178
00:22:11,325 --> 00:22:15,125
三段飛ばしに跳ねていく
leaping three steps at a time.

179
00:22:15,125 --> 00:22:18,925
馬車の中で震えてた
I was trembling inside the carriage,

180
00:22:18,925 --> 00:22:22,625
惨めな古着
in miserable old clothes.

181
00:22:22,625 --> 00:22:27,625
めくり廻る夜の舞踏
The night's ball turning round and round.

182
00:22:28,125 --> 00:22:31,625
見知らぬ顔探す
Searching for an unfamiliar face,

183
00:22:31,625 --> 00:22:35,125
囁くあの声が
that whispering voice...

184
00:22:35,125 --> 00:22:39,125
握り締めた刃突き立て
Thrust the blade you tightly gripped,

185
00:22:39,125 --> 00:22:41,625
すべてを奪えと
to snatch everything away.

186
00:22:41,625 --> 00:22:45,125
みなしご集う城
In the castle where orphans gather,

187
00:22:45,125 --> 00:22:48,625
笑み仮面に描いて
painting smiles on their masks.

188
00:22:48,625 --> 00:22:52,625
偽りの慈しみさえ
Even false affection...

189
00:22:52,625 --> 00:22:56,125
羽で包む熾天使
a seraph wraps in its wings.

190
00:23:07,625 --> 00:23:11,625
灰の中で赤く溶けて混じる
Melting and mixing red in the ashes,

191
00:23:11,625 --> 00:23:15,125
硝子の靴
the glass slipper.

192
00:23:15,125 --> 00:23:18,925
今更帰る 震えているの
Returning now, are you trembling?

193
00:23:18,925 --> 00:23:22,625
あなたが目をやる時計
The clock you glance at...

194
00:23:22,625 --> 00:23:26,625
靴脱ぎ踊るスロープ抜けて
Slipping off shoes, escaping down the slope,

195
00:23:26,625 --> 00:23:30,125
喉まで伸びる指の先で
with fingertips reaching to the throat.

196
00:23:30,125 --> 00:23:33,925
掬う雫口付けして
Kissing the scooped-up drop,

197
00:23:33,925 --> 00:23:38,125
走る衝動 背骨抜けていく
a rushing impulse runs down the spine,

198
00:23:38,125 --> 00:23:41,125
切なさ
such heartbreak.

199
00:23:48,125 --> 00:23:51,625
鐘は鳴らさないで
Don't let the bell toll,

200
00:23:51,625 --> 00:23:55,325
あなたにひざまづき
kneeling down to you.

201
00:23:55,325 --> 00:23:58,625
まだダメと叫んだ右手
The right hand that cried, "Not yet!"

202
00:23:58,625 --> 00:24:02,125
突き刺すサヨナラ
thrusts a parting blow.

203
00:24:02,125 --> 00:24:05,625
消せない硝煙を香水に纏う姫
A princess wearing indelible gunpowder smoke as perfume.

204
00:24:05,625 --> 00:24:09,125
強い瞳 僕の凍った
Strong eyes pierce right through...

205
00:24:09,125 --> 00:24:12,625
仮面ごと撃ち抜く
my frozen mask.

206
00:24:21,125 --> 00:24:24,925
今も耳にあなたの吐息が
Even now, your breath pierces my ears...

207
00:24:24,925 --> 00:24:28,625
突き刺さるの 遠い夢
like a distant dream.

208
00:24:28,625 --> 00:24:32,325
ステンドグラスごし光る月が
The moon shining through stained glass...

209
00:24:32,325 --> 00:24:36,125
君にかぶせたベール
casts a veil over you.

210
00:24:36,125 --> 00:24:39,925
ドレス膝で裂いて
Tearing the dress at the knees,

211
00:24:39,925 --> 00:24:43,625
ティアラは投げ捨てて
throwing away the tiara.

212
00:24:43,625 --> 00:24:47,325
見つめ合う瞳と瞳が
Eyes gazing into eyes...

213
00:24:47,325 --> 00:24:51,125
火花を放つ
send sparks flying.

214
00:25:00,146 --> 00:25:03,646
孤独な魂が 炎をあげ 惹かれあう
Lonely souls ignite in flames, drawn to each other.

215
00:25:03,646 --> 00:25:06,646
その涙すくえないなら
If I cannot save those tears,

216
00:25:06,646 --> 00:25:10,246
まるで一人遊び
It's just like playing alone.

217
00:25:10,246 --> 00:25:13,646
時よ止まれ 今は
Time, stand still, for now...

218
00:25:13,646 --> 00:25:17,446
あなたに酔いしれて
I am intoxicated by you.

219
00:25:17,446 --> 00:25:21,146
揺れる鼓動一つ一つを
Every single swaying heartbeat,

220
00:25:21,146 --> 00:25:25,646
刻みつけてたい
I want to carve deep into my memory.

221
00:25:25,646 --> 00:25:28,946
とどまれ 熱く濡れ
Stay, passionately drenched,

222
00:25:28,946 --> 00:25:32,346
打ち付ける高まりに
amid this pounding surge of excitement,

223
00:25:32,346 --> 00:25:35,946
これ以上は動けないよ
I can't move any further than this.

224
00:25:35,946 --> 00:25:41,646
まるでペアに似てる
It's almost as if we're a pair.

225
00:26:03,946 --> 00:26:06,346
そばにいても 離れたまま
Even side by side, we remain apart,

226
00:26:06,346 --> 00:26:12,646
ひとつになれない連星 アルビレオ
a binary star, Albireo, that can never become one.

227
00:26:25,946 --> 00:26:29,946
ああ 君が思うよりも 僕は君でいっぱいだ
Ah, more than you think, I am completely filled with you.

228
00:26:29,946 --> 00:26:33,946
流星みたいな移ろいを
A fleeting shift like a shooting star,

229
00:26:33,946 --> 00:26:38,946
片時も離さず見ていたいのか
I want to watch without taking my eyes off even for a moment.

230
00:26:38,946 --> 00:26:42,946
ああ 僕が思うよりも 君はずっとずっと遠い
Ah, more than I think, you are so much further away.

231
00:26:42,946 --> 00:26:48,946
重なったように見える仕草
Gestures that look as though they overlap...

232
00:26:48,946 --> 00:26:53,146
苦しくなるほどに美しいな
are beautiful to the point of hurting.

233
00:26:53,146 --> 00:26:59,146
君が好きって感情が 残らず夜空を飾っている
The feeling of liking you decorates the entire night sky.

234
00:26:59,146 --> 00:27:03,146
心が余った言い訳を
An excuse born from an overflowing heart,

235
00:27:03,146 --> 00:27:07,146
愛だなんて呼びたくない
I don't want to call something like love.

236
00:27:07,146 --> 00:27:13,646
君は藍に浮かんだアルビレオ この心を奪ったまま
Floating in indigo, you are Albireo, having stolen my heart away.

237
00:27:13,646 --> 00:27:17,146
いらないのなら返してよ
If you don't need it, give it back,

238
00:27:17,146 --> 00:27:20,646
他に置き場もないけどさ
even though I have nowhere else to put it.

239
00:27:20,646 --> 00:27:23,946
いまもアイミスユーの切れ端が
Even now, fragments of "I miss you"

240
00:27:23,946 --> 00:27:27,346
成層圏で燃えて
burn up in the stratosphere.

241
00:27:27,346 --> 00:27:30,946
そばにいても離れたまま
Even side by side, we remain apart,

242
00:27:30,946 --> 00:27:35,146
ひとつになれない連星 アルビレオ
a binary star, Albireo, that can never become one.

243
00:27:40,646 --> 00:27:47,646
何光年先で輝いてる 君に君に恋をしたんだ
I fell in love with you, shining light-years away.

244
00:27:47,646 --> 00:27:54,146
何光年か測れぬほど 君の光が眩しすぎたから
Because your light was far too dazzling to measure how many light-years away it was...

245
00:27:54,146 --> 00:27:56,646
から
Because...

246
00:27:58,146 --> 00:28:04,346
君が好きって感情で それだけで星が回っている
Just with the feeling of liking you, the stars keep revolving.

247
00:28:04,346 --> 00:28:08,146
明日を生きぬく言い訳を
An excuse to live through tomorrow,

248
00:28:08,146 --> 00:28:12,146
愛だなんて呼んでみたい
I want to try calling it love.

249
00:28:12,146 --> 00:28:18,946
君は藍に浮かんだアルビレオ この心を奪ったまま
Floating in indigo, you are Albireo, having stolen my heart away.

250
00:28:18,946 --> 00:28:22,346
いらないのなら返してよ
If you don't need it, give it back,

251
00:28:22,346 --> 00:28:25,646
他に置き場もないけどさ
even though I have nowhere else to put it.

252
00:28:25,646 --> 00:28:29,146
いまもアイミスユーの切れ端が
Even now, fragments of "I miss you"

253
00:28:29,146 --> 00:28:32,646
成層圏で燃えて
burn up in the stratosphere.

254
00:28:32,646 --> 00:28:35,946
そばにいても離れたまま
Even side by side, we remain apart,

255
00:28:35,946 --> 00:28:39,146
ひとつになれない連星
a binary star that can never become one.

256
00:28:39,146 --> 00:28:45,946
君は愛の色さ アルビレオ この心焦がしたんだ
You are the color of love, Albireo, scorching my heart.

257
00:28:45,946 --> 00:28:49,146
誰より近く恋してた
I was in love with you closer than anyone else,

258
00:28:49,146 --> 00:28:52,646
届くわけもないのにさ
even though it could never reach you.

259
00:28:52,646 --> 00:28:56,146
いまも温度を超えた高なりが
Even now, a pounding pulse exceeding temperature

260
00:28:56,146 --> 00:28:59,146
君が好きと叫ぶ
shouts out that I love you.

261
00:28:59,146 --> 00:29:02,146
離れていても消えないまま
Even separated, without fading away,

262
00:29:02,146 --> 00:29:05,646
ふたつになれない二重星
a double star that can never split into two,

263
00:29:05,646 --> 00:29:08,146
アルビレオ
Albireo.

264
00:29:55,146 --> 00:29:59,646
子どもの頃 見上げた
When I was a child, I looked up at...

265
00:30:01,367 --> 00:30:03,667
夜の空に
In the night sky,

266
00:30:03,667 --> 00:30:06,167
想いを抱いた
I held my feelings.

267
00:30:06,167 --> 00:30:09,667
あのひとつひとつに
In each and every one of them,

268
00:30:09,667 --> 00:30:14,167
誰かの願いがこもってる
someone's wish is contained.

269
00:30:18,167 --> 00:30:20,667
そのひとつが
If one of those

270
00:30:20,667 --> 00:30:23,667
あなたで
is you,

271
00:30:23,667 --> 00:30:28,167
すぐとなりで笑ってて
smiling right beside me...

272
00:30:28,167 --> 00:30:31,667
ねぇ 時間を止めれるなら
Hey, if I could stop time,

273
00:30:31,667 --> 00:30:37,167
この1秒を切り取って
I'd capture this single second.

274
00:30:41,667 --> 00:30:46,667
星降る夜に
On a starry night,

275
00:30:46,667 --> 00:30:51,667
ただあなたに会いたい
I just want to see you.

276
00:30:51,667 --> 00:30:57,167
あなたの名前を 祈るようにそっと
Softly whispering your name as if praying,

277
00:30:57,167 --> 00:31:08,167
何度も抱きしめているよ
I hold you close time and time again.

278
00:30:10,667 --> 00:31:15,167
もう私も大人ね
I've grown up now too, haven't I?

279
00:31:15,167 --> 00:31:17,667
変わったこと
Things that have changed,

280
00:31:17,667 --> 00:31:19,967
変わらないこと
things that remain the same...

281
00:31:19,967 --> 00:31:23,667
止まらない時計の針が
The unstoppable hands of the clock

282
00:31:23,667 --> 00:31:28,167
冷たく胸を刻んだ
cold-heartedly carved into my heart.

283
00:31:32,167 --> 00:31:37,667
でもあなたに出会って
But after meeting you,

284
00:31:37,667 --> 00:31:43,167
日々の眩しさを教えて
you showed me the brilliance of each day.

285
00:31:43,167 --> 00:31:46,167
まだ少し怖いけど
Though I'm still a little afraid,

286
00:31:46,167 --> 00:31:51,167
今を生み出せる気がしてるよ
I feel like I can create a new present now.

287
00:31:52,167 --> 00:31:57,667
星降る夜に
On a starry night,

288
00:31:57,667 --> 00:32:03,167
会いたいが集まるばかり
my longing to see you only grows.

289
00:32:03,167 --> 00:32:08,667
あなたの名前を 祈るようにそっと
Softly whispering your name as if praying,

290
00:32:08,667 --> 00:32:14,667
何度も抱きしめているよ
I hold you close time and time again.

291
00:32:14,667 --> 00:32:19,667
高鳴る鼓動が
My racing heartbeat

292
00:32:19,667 --> 00:32:25,667
体を追い越していく
gets ahead of my own body.

293
00:32:25,667 --> 00:32:30,967
私の名前を 特別にしてくれたの
You made my name something special.

294
00:32:30,967 --> 00:32:37,667
今はただ抱きしめてたいの
Right now, I just want to hold you close.

295
00:32:38,167 --> 00:32:41,667
いつも想ってるよ
I'm always thinking of you.

296
00:32:41,667 --> 00:32:48,167
かじかんだ手に ぬくもり
Warmth for these numb hands...

297
00:32:53,167 --> 00:32:57,167
目を閉じて
Close your eyes,

298
00:32:57,167 --> 00:33:03,167
その先へ
and move beyond.

299
00:33:05,667 --> 00:33:11,167
星降る夜に
On a starry night,

300
00:33:11,167 --> 00:33:16,667
ただあなたに会いたい
I just want to see you.

301
00:33:16,667 --> 00:33:22,167
あなたの名前を 祈るようにそっと
Softly whispering your name as if praying,

302
00:33:22,167 --> 00:33:27,667
何度も抱きしめているよ
I hold you close time and time again.

303
00:33:27,667 --> 00:33:33,167
高鳴る鼓動で
With my heart pounding fast,

304
00:33:33,167 --> 00:33:38,667
裸足のまま駆けていく
I run barefoot.

305
00:33:38,667 --> 00:33:44,167
私の名前を 特別にしてくれたの
You made my name something special.

306
00:33:44,167 --> 00:33:51,167
あなたが照らし続けてる
You continue to shine your light.

307
00:33:51,167 --> 00:33:58,167
星降る夜に
On a starry night...

308
00:34:35,667 --> 00:34:38,667
Seid ihr das Essen? Nein, wir sind der Jäger!
Are you the prey? No, we are the hunter!

309
00:34:38,967 --> 00:34:43,967
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen
Crimson bow and arrow

310
00:34:50,167 --> 00:34:54,167
踏まれた花の 名前も知らずに
Without knowing the name of the trampled flower,

311
00:34:54,167 --> 00:34:59,167
地に墜ちた鳥は 風を待ち侘びる
the fallen bird eagerly awaits the wind.

312
00:35:00,188 --> 00:35:01,188
踏まれた
...trampled

313
00:35:01,288 --> 00:35:03,588
花の名前も知らずに
Without even knowing the name of the flower,

314
00:35:03,688 --> 00:35:05,988
地に堕ちた鳥は風を待ち侘びる
the fallen bird eagerly awaits the wind.

315
00:35:06,188 --> 00:35:08,388
祈ったところで何も変わらない
Praying will change nothing.

316
00:35:08,488 --> 00:35:11,388
今を変えるのは戦う覚悟だ
What changes the present is the resolve to fight...

317
00:35:11,488 --> 00:35:13,488
屍踏み越えて
Stepping over corpses,

318
00:35:13,588 --> 00:35:16,988
進む意思を嗤う豚よ
pigs that sneer at the will to press forward,

319
00:35:17,188 --> 00:35:21,988
家畜の安寧 虚偽の繁栄 死せる餓狼の自由を!
enjoy livestock's peace, false prosperity, and freedom!

320
00:35:22,188 --> 00:35:24,588
囚われた屈辱は
The humiliation of captivity

321
00:35:24,688 --> 00:35:27,388
反撃の嚆矢だ
is the signal arrow for counterattack.

322
00:35:27,488 --> 00:35:30,188
城壁の其の彼方
Beyond those city walls,

323
00:35:30,288 --> 00:35:32,988
獲物を屠る Jäger!
slaying the prey—Jäger!

324
00:35:33,088 --> 00:35:36,988
迸る殺意に 其の身を灼きながら
As your body burns with surging intent to kill,

325
00:35:37,088 --> 00:35:40,988
黄昏に緋を穿つ
pierce the twilight with scarlet—

326
00:35:41,088 --> 00:35:44,388
紅蓮の弓矢
the Crimson Bow and Arrow!

327
00:36:04,388 --> 00:36:09,688
矢を番え追いかける 標的は逃がさない
Nocking an arrow and giving chase, never letting it escape.

328
00:36:09,788 --> 00:36:14,988
矢を放ち追い詰める 決して逃がさない
Releasing the arrow and cornering it, never letting it escape.

329
00:36:15,188 --> 00:36:20,188
限界まで引き絞る はじ切れそうな弦
Drawing the bowstring to its limit, almost snapping,

330
00:36:20,288 --> 00:36:25,688
標的が息絶えるまで 何度でも放つ
loose again and again until the target stops breathing.

331
00:36:25,788 --> 00:36:30,988
獲物を殺すのは 凶器でも技術でもない
What kills the prey is neither weapon nor skill,

332
00:36:31,088 --> 00:36:36,388
研ぎ澄まされた お前自身の殺意だ
it is your own honed intent to kill.

333
00:36:36,488 --> 00:36:41,988
Wir sind der Jäger 焔のように熱く!
Wir sind der Jäger, hot as flames!

334
00:36:42,188 --> 00:36:47,488
Wir sind der Jäger 氷のように冷ややかに!
Wir sind der Jäger, cold as ice!

335
00:36:47,588 --> 00:36:52,688
Wir sind der Jäger 己を矢に込めて!
Wir sind der Jäger, pouring ourselves into the arrow!

336
00:36:52,788 --> 00:36:59,188
Wir sind der Jäger 全てを貫いて征け!
Wir sind der Jäger, pierce through everything!

337
00:37:30,188 --> 00:37:32,988
Angriff auf die Titanen.
Attack on the Titans.

338
00:37:33,188 --> 00:37:38,988
Der Junge von einst wird bald zum Schwert greifen.
The boy of back then will soon reach for the sword.

339
00:37:42,188 --> 00:37:47,688
Wer nur seine Ohnmacht bedauert, kann nichts verändern.
Those who merely lament powerlessness change nothing.

340
00:37:47,788 --> 00:37:53,188
Der Junge von einst wird bald das schwarze Schwert ergreifen.
The boy of back then will soon grasp the black sword.

341
00:37:53,288 --> 00:37:57,988
Hass und Zorn sind eine zweischneidige Klinge.
Hatred and anger are a double-edged blade.

342
00:37:58,088 --> 00:38:03,188
Bald, eines Tages, wird er dem Schicksal die Zähne zeigen.
Soon, one day, he will bare his teeth at fate.

343
00:38:03,688 --> 00:38:08,988
何かを変えることができるのは
The ones who can change something

344
00:38:09,088 --> 00:38:14,388
何かを捨てることができるもの
are those capable of casting something aside.

345
00:38:14,488 --> 00:38:19,688
何一つリスク等背負わないままで
Without taking on any risk,

346
00:38:19,788 --> 00:38:24,188
何かが叶う等...
expecting something to come true...

347
00:38:24,288 --> 00:38:29,388
暗愚の想定 ただの幻影 今は無謀な勇気も
Foolish assumptions, mere illusions; reckless courage,

348
00:38:29,488 --> 00:38:34,988
自由の先鋒 賭けの攻勢 走る奴隷に勝利を!
freedom's vanguard—victory to the running slaves!

349
00:38:35,088 --> 00:38:40,188
架せられた不条理は 進撃の嚆矢だ
The absurdity imposed upon us is the signal arrow of attack.

350
00:38:40,288 --> 00:38:45,488
奪われた其の地平 世界を望む《自由》
Beyond that stolen horizon lies freedom—Eren!

351
00:38:45,588 --> 00:38:50,988
止まらない衝動に 其の身を侵されながら
As your body is consumed by unstoppable impulse,

352
00:38:51,088 --> 00:38:56,688
宵闇に紫を運ぶ――冥府の弓矢
carry purple into dusk—the Bow and Arrow of the Underworld!

353
00:39:33,688 --> 00:39:39,988
ということで！スペシャルゲスト、かわいいかわいいちまちゃんに来ていただきましたー！
And with that! Our special guest, the super cute Chima-chan, has joined us!

354
00:39:40,188 --> 00:39:45,988
はーい！にじさんじ所属、上から読んでも下から読んでも町田ちまです！ニコちゃんお誕生日おめでとうー！
Hi! From Nijisanji, whether you read it forwards or backwards, I'm Machita Chima! Happy Birthday, Niko-chan!

355
00:39:46,188 --> 00:39:49,188
ありがとう、ちまちゃん！
Thank you, Chima-chan!

356
00:39:49,388 --> 00:39:52,688
気づいたらこんなことになってたね、ちまちゃん。
Before I knew it, things ended up like this, Chima-chan.

357
00:39:52,788 --> 00:39:54,188
なんかね、大きくなっちゃってた。
Somehow, I grew really big.

358
00:39:54,288 --> 00:39:58,188
大きくなっちゃってるっていうか... すごいサイズになってるんだけど...
Saying you "grew big" is an understatement... You're an incredible size...

359
00:39:58,288 --> 00:39:59,988
後ろから光もさ...
And there's even light radiating from behind you...

360
00:40:00,809 --> 00:40:02,009
そんなの後光が綺麗でしょう？
That halo in the back looks pretty, right?

361
00:40:02,009 --> 00:40:04,309
綺麗だねー 似合うよ、ちまちゃん
It's pretty! It suits you, Chima-chan.

362
00:40:04,309 --> 00:40:05,109
ありがとう
Thank you.

363
00:40:05,309 --> 00:40:08,709
いや、今日はね、ちまちゃんと「火炎」を歌わせていただいたんだけど
Today, Chima-chan and I got to sing "Kaen,"

364
00:40:08,709 --> 00:40:12,309
やっぱりちまちゃんのハイトーンも好きなんだけど
and while I love Chima-chan's high tones,

365
00:40:12,309 --> 00:40:14,509
かっこよさも好きなのよ
I also love how cool you can sound!

366
00:40:14,509 --> 00:40:15,309
おー、ありがとう
Oh, thank you.

367
00:40:15,309 --> 00:40:18,309
なんかそんなふたつを混ぜられたらいいなと思って今回選びました
I chose this song hoping we could blend those two together.

368
00:40:18,309 --> 00:40:21,109
ありがとう 一緒に歌えて嬉しかったー
Thank you! I was so happy to sing together!

369
00:40:21,109 --> 00:40:22,709
えー！良かったー！
Yay, I'm so glad!

370
00:40:22,709 --> 00:40:25,609
にこたんとバトルできて楽しかったー
Battling with Nico-tan was so much fun!

371
00:40:25,609 --> 00:40:27,909
もう大変だったよ、もう！
It was so intense, seriously!

372
00:40:28,109 --> 00:40:31,109
パカパカパカから嬉しいです
I'm so happy!

373
00:40:33,309 --> 00:40:35,509
え、あのゴーレムは何だったの？
Wait, what was that golem back there?

374
00:40:35,509 --> 00:40:39,009
うん、あれは町田の眷属のゴーレムです
Mm, that was the golem of Machita's kin.

375
00:40:39,009 --> 00:40:42,309
そうだよね！言わせたみたいになってるけど…
Right! It feels like I forced you to say that, but...

376
00:40:42,309 --> 00:40:46,609
いやもう、すごい強かったよ、町田ちゃんのゴーレムが！
Man, Machita-chan's golem was super strong!

377
00:40:46,609 --> 00:40:49,809
ねー、めちゃくちゃ強かったけど、倒されちゃったんだよね、にこちゃんに
Yeah, it was super strong, but Nico-chan defeated it!

378
00:40:49,809 --> 00:40:52,509
そうだよね、にこたん強かったからね
That's right, Nico-tan was really strong!

379
00:40:52,509 --> 00:40:56,709
にこちゃんのおかげでなんか町田自身もパワーが…
Thanks to Nico-chan, Machita herself lost her power...

380
00:40:56,709 --> 00:40:57,809
あ、そがれて…
Ah, drained...

381
00:40:57,809 --> 00:41:00,009
ちまちゃん！あーもうダメかも知れない！
Chima-chan! Ah, I might not make it!

382
00:41:00,009 --> 00:41:01,509
時間が、ない！
There's no time!

383
00:41:01,509 --> 00:41:05,109
にこちゃん本当におめでとう！ありがとう！これからもよろしくね！またね！バイバイ！
Nico-chan, happy birthday! Thank you so much! Looking forward to working together! See ya! Bye-bye!

384
00:41:05,109 --> 00:41:08,709
バイバーイ！
Bye-bye!

385
00:41:17,009 --> 00:41:21,209
Party is over

386
00:41:21,509 --> 00:41:27,109
それでも踊りたかった
Still, I wanted to dance

387
00:41:27,409 --> 00:41:32,109
眠れないくらい
So restless I can't sleep,

388
00:41:32,609 --> 00:41:38,409
情熱の火はいつしか いつつの日にか
the flame of passion will, before I know it, someday...

389
00:41:38,509 --> 00:41:44,409
端から気づいている 炎はいつか消える
I've known from the start that the flame will eventually go out

390
00:41:44,409 --> 00:41:48,509
ねえ 何も要らないはずだった
Hey, I wasn't supposed to need anything

391
00:41:48,509 --> 00:41:50,709
なのにまだ I'm so serious
Yet I'm still so serious

392
00:41:50,709 --> 00:41:55,409
ああ まだ間に合う
Ah, there's still time

393
00:41:56,009 --> 00:42:00,309
ああ ただ burn it up baby
Ah, just burn it up baby

394
00:42:00,309 --> 00:42:04,109
Sorry darling そんなに甘くないよ
Sorry darling, it's not that sweet

395
00:42:04,109 --> 00:42:07,609
でもきっとそんなに悪くないよ
But surely it's not that bad

396
00:42:07,609 --> 00:42:11,109
ああ Give me fire
Ah, give me fire

397
00:42:11,109 --> 00:42:13,409
Light it up baby 燃やしちゃうぜ yeah
Light it up baby, we'll burn it up, yeah

398
00:42:24,609 --> 00:42:34,209
Yeah...

399
00:42:40,109 --> 00:42:45,509
燃えろよ 燃えろよ 炎よ燃えろ
Burn, burn, burn, oh flame

400
00:42:45,509 --> 00:42:51,409
千代も八千代も変わりもせずに 人のなりいとをかし 全部燃やせ八百屋お七
Unchanging through thousands of years, human nature is so curious, burn it all, Yaoya Oshichi!

401
00:42:51,409 --> 00:42:54,309
出でよ 舞えよ 火の粉 焚き付けるのが仕事
Come forth, dance, sparks! Kindling the fire is my job

402
00:42:54,309 --> 00:42:57,309
ガソリンとステロイド 燃えるさまはお見事
Gasoline and steroids, what a splendid sight as it burns

403
00:42:57,309 --> 00:43:00,209
火遊びはしない ぬるいまね出来ない
I don't play with fire, no half-hearted moves here

404
00:43:00,209 --> 00:43:03,009
しけたカルマ トラウマ 燃やし尽くす マグマ ドラマ
Stale karma and trauma, burning it out, magma drama

405
00:43:03,009 --> 00:43:05,909
この飽くなき渇き 青い炎みたい
This insatiable thirst, like a blue flame

406
00:43:05,909 --> 00:43:09,009
死は過去のひとつ隣 やがて全てひとつとなり
Death is just next to the past, soon everything becomes one

407
00:43:09,009 --> 00:43:12,909
Love is dying

408
00:43:12,909 --> 00:43:18,909
でもまだ消えてないから
But since it hasn't gone out yet

409
00:43:18,909 --> 00:43:24,509
忘れてみたい
I want to try forgetting it

410
00:43:24,509 --> 00:43:30,409
情熱の火はいつしか いつつの日にか
The flame of passion will, before I know it, someday...

411
00:43:30,409 --> 00:43:36,309
身体は気づいている 僕らはいつか消える
My body realizes that one day we will disappear

412
00:43:36,309 --> 00:43:39,309
緩やかに若さを溶かして
Slowly melting youth away

413
00:43:39,309 --> 00:43:42,009
泣かないで Why so serious?
Don't cry, why so serious?

414
00:43:42,009 --> 00:43:47,509
ああ まだ間に合う
Ah, there's still time

415
00:43:47,509 --> 00:43:51,809
ああ ただ burn it up baby
Ah, just burn it up baby

416
00:43:51,809 --> 00:43:55,509
Sorry darling そんなに甘くないよ
Sorry darling, it's not that sweet

417
00:43:55,509 --> 00:43:58,909
でもきっとそんなに悪くないよ
But surely it's not that bad

418
00:43:58,909 --> 00:44:02,409
ああ Give me fire
Ah, give me fire

419
00:44:02,409 --> 00:44:04,809
Light it up baby 燃やしちゃうぜ yeah
Light it up baby, we'll burn it up, yeah

420
00:44:16,309 --> 00:44:23,209
Yeah...

421
00:44:23,209 --> 00:44:26,209
足りない 足りない 足りない 注ぐ火に油！
Not enough, not enough, not enough! Adding fuel to the fire!

422
00:44:26,209 --> 00:44:28,309
Sorry darling hurry up

423
00:44:28,309 --> 00:44:30,009
ああ まだ間に合う
Ah, there's still time

424
